v:REQ-12_5_2 a v:RequirementSection ; v:section "12.5.2" ; v:sourceDocument "requirements.md" .
v:OBS-PROFILE-admission a v:ObservationProfile .
v:OBS-PROFILE-admission v:metricIntent "Offered/admitted/rejected work by bounded class; replay attempts, first admissions, dedup observations and retained-status occupancy distinct." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-admission v:eventIntent "Safe admission/denial/context disposition." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-admission v:logIntent "Optional actionable invalid-contract summary." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-admission v:traceIntent "Request to resolution/preparation, with bounded causal links." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-admission v:latencyQuestion "Local ingress to disposition; queue age separate." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-admission v:trafficQuestion "Logical offers at this boundary, retries and fan-out separate." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-admission v:errorQuestion "Denied/stale/unsupported/capacity, intent mismatch and retired/unavailable status versus invariant fault; internal labels are not public disclosure policy." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-admission v:saturationQuestion "All applicable resource coordinates/scopes, queue/input/participant/staging reservations and protected partitions; soft targets never grant hard capacity." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-publication a v:ObservationProfile .
v:OBS-PROFILE-publication v:metricIntent "Preparation/validation/publication duration and outcome classes." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-publication v:eventIntent "Applied, validated unchanged success or unchanged rejection after actual authoritative disposition." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-publication v:logIntent "Unexpected invariant failure, never a source diff." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-publication v:traceIntent "Preparation linked to one atomic publication or validated no-op disposition, never a fabricated commit. Distinguish source mapping from authored field changes, owned before/candidate target validation and private annotation-set dependency validation without exporting hidden participants." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-publication v:latencyQuestion "Preparation versus final critical section; pending age included." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-publication v:trafficQuestion "Logical commits, validated unchanged successes and rejections separate; affected participants and attempts distinct, never partial-success counts." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-publication v:errorQuestion "Dependency/scope conflict versus integrity fault." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-publication v:saturationQuestion "Staging, inverse/history and promised-completion resources." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-release a v:ObservationProfile .
v:OBS-PROFILE-release v:metricIntent "Authorized/unavailable releases, bytes and pending-age classes; context offers/installations/refusals, live selectors and held-retired context pressure in declared units, not public hidden counts." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-release v:eventIntent "Single/version-set context all-required install/refuse, parent/member invalidation/owner-stop/final hold discharge, expiry, gap, resync and safe whole-report release dispositions; no public failing-member index; internal causes are distinct from recipient-projected reasons and recovery hints." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-release v:logIntent "Optional bounded release-protocol fault." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-release v:traceIntent "Reserved coherent capture to registry installation/current-authorized delivery, owner stop to actual hold discharge, with recipient-scoped bounded links; no raw selector or root generation labels." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-release v:latencyQuestion "Query preparation, release wait and delivery observation distinct." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-release v:trafficQuestion "Queries, deliveries and resyncs; sampled records are not totals." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-release v:errorQuestion "Revoked/stale/unavailable safely projected; disclosure/refusal/loss distinct from operation/provider failure. No unauthorized existence disclosure except declared operational disclosures; withheld counts are not observed zero." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-release v:saturationQuestion "Prepared/queued projections, retained contexts/snapshots, version-set parent/member metadata, typed selector and internal hold records, aggregate complete reply reservations and subscription capacity; logical invalidation does not refund still-held roots." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-effect a v:ObservationProfile .
v:OBS-PROFILE-effect v:metricIntent "Logical effects, attempts, dispatch/ack duration and unknown age." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-effect v:eventIntent "Dispatch, trusted receipt, contradiction and reconciliation." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-effect v:logIntent "Safe provider protocol fault, without payload or locator." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-effect v:traceIntent "Immutable capture linked to each attempt and late evidence." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-effect v:latencyQuestion "Queue, service and receipt-observation delay separate." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-effect v:trafficQuestion "Logical effect versus retries/physical attempts." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-effect v:errorQuestion "Failure/unknown/cancel/late applicability and acknowledgment strength distinct." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-effect v:saturationQuestion "Outstanding effects, per-destination queue and completion reservations." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-derived a v:ObservationProfile .
v:OBS-PROFILE-derived v:metricIntent "Work, acceptance, partial coverage and stale-result classes." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-derived v:eventIntent "Invalidation, supersession, fallback and budget disposition." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-derived v:logIntent "Grammar/provider fault without source fragments." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-derived v:traceIntent "Source/context to worker completion to acceptance." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-derived v:latencyQuestion "Queue, service and result age in a declared clock domain." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-derived v:trafficQuestion "Submitted/accepted/superseded work; completeness scoped explicitly." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-derived v:errorQuestion "Malformed source data versus unavailable provider/stale context/fault." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-derived v:saturationQuestion "Regions, fan-out, traversal, retained cells and worker pressure." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-history a v:ObservationProfile .
v:OBS-PROFILE-history v:metricIntent "Reversal outcomes, group size and retained inverse cost buckets." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-history v:eventIntent "Applied, blocked, empty or unavailable history." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-history v:logIntent "Unexpected history-integrity fault." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-history v:traceIntent "All-participant frontier validation to atomic field-journal reversal; distinguish actual source inverse mapping, fresh authored versions and complete linked redo invalidation." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-history v:latencyQuestion "Validation and publication, not presumed replay time." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-history v:trafficQuestion "Logical reversal attempts versus participants." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-history v:errorQuestion "Rights/frontier/retention rejection versus invariant fault." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-history v:saturationQuestion "Linked history/inverse retention and consistent floors." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-fidelity a v:ObservationProfile .
v:OBS-PROFILE-fidelity v:metricIntent "Encoding/mapping preparation, byte and per-artifact outcome classes." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-fidelity v:eventIntent "Conversion rejection, target detachment and independent artifact outcome." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-fidelity v:logIntent "Safe codec/mapping fault, no snippets." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-fidelity v:traceIntent "Identified snapshot through payload preparation." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-fidelity v:latencyQuestion "Preparation separate from physical write/ack." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-fidelity v:trafficQuestion "Source and annotation artifacts separately counted." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-fidelity v:errorQuestion "Invalid boundary/conversion versus external failure/unknown." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-fidelity v:saturationQuestion "Source/annotation candidate bytes, mappings and inverse retention." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-lifecycle a v:ObservationProfile .
v:OBS-PROFILE-lifecycle v:metricIntent "Open/reuse/rebind/disposal dispositions and retained obligations." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-lifecycle v:eventIntent "Alias, incarnation, binding and disposal transitions." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-lifecycle v:logIntent "Safe identity/continuity contract fault." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-lifecycle v:traceIntent "Resolve to authorized activation or refusal." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-lifecycle v:latencyQuestion "Host resolution, admission and disposal wait separate." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-lifecycle v:trafficQuestion "Alias reuse is not new ownership; close is not full reclamation." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-lifecycle v:errorQuestion "Known conflict, unknown identity and retained-obligation refusal distinct." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-lifecycle v:saturationQuestion "Live objects, retained snapshots/history and pending writes." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-activation a v:ObservationProfile .
v:OBS-PROFILE-activation v:metricIntent "Candidates, activation/rejection and retained generation classes." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-activation v:eventIntent "Atomic activation, supersession and declared degradation." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-activation v:logIntent "Bounded schema/profile incompatibility." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-activation v:traceIntent "External preparation to atomic accepted activation." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-activation v:latencyQuestion "Staging separate from activation; no hidden network in publication." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-activation v:trafficQuestion "Candidates/activations versus invalidated downstream work." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-activation v:errorQuestion "Unsupported schema/collision/denied/stale context versus fault." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-activation v:saturationQuestion "Old provider assets, staged profiles and in-flight generations." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-geometry a v:ObservationProfile .
v:OBS-PROFILE-geometry v:metricIntent "Layout/reuse/accept/submission and budget classes." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-geometry v:eventIntent "Geometry invalidation and capability fallback." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-geometry v:logIntent "Safe unsupported or inconsistent geometry summary." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-geometry v:traceIntent "Logical context to accepted geometry and presentation submission." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-geometry v:latencyQuestion "Measured layout/submission only; actual display time may be unobservable." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-geometry v:trafficQuestion "Accepted work versus invalidated/coalesced layouts." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-geometry v:errorQuestion "Wrong generation/unsupported domain versus provider fault." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-geometry v:saturationQuestion "Rows, decorations, retained layout and presentation work." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-native a v:ObservationProfile .
v:OBS-PROFILE-native v:metricIntent "Accepted/committed/cancelled input and accessibility classes." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-native v:eventIntent "Input-session/focus/capability dispositions without content." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-native v:logIntent "Safe wrong-context/native capability failure." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-native v:traceIntent "Native event to semantic admission and submission." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-native v:latencyQuestion "Input observation to commit/submission, not user-perception time." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-native v:trafficQuestion "Input classes and semantic commits; no text/keystroke dump." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-native v:errorQuestion "Late composition/wrong focus/unsupported mapping versus fault." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-native v:saturationQuestion "Preedit, pending announcements and bounded native payloads." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-diagnostics a v:ObservationProfile .
v:OBS-PROFILE-diagnostics v:metricIntent "Capture/drop/coalescing/queue/drain/health classes." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-diagnostics v:eventIntent "Capture policy, loss and consumer-state changes." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-diagnostics v:logIntent "Outside recursive capture failure; sanitized actionable summaries only." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-diagnostics v:traceIntent "Optional bounded capture/drain/export links." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-diagnostics v:latencyQuestion "Capture cost, queue age and drain/export delay separate." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-diagnostics v:trafficQuestion "Observation records versus semantic operations; never infer one from the other." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-diagnostics v:errorQuestion "Collection denied/off/lost/unknown/export fault distinct." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-diagnostics v:saturationQuestion "Record bytes, series growth, queue and consumer capacity." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-shutdown a v:ObservationProfile .
v:OBS-PROFILE-shutdown v:metricIntent "Admission stop, outstanding/unknown work and wait age." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-shutdown v:eventIntent "Disposition, stop/drain, wait cut and escalation." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-shutdown v:logIntent "Bounded actionable owner/service integrity fault." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-shutdown v:traceIntent "Shutdown request to bounded-wait disposition and later evidence." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-shutdown v:latencyQuestion "Wait limit is not worker lifetime or guaranteed effect completion." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-shutdown v:trafficQuestion "Stop/control events versus remaining effects and workers." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-shutdown v:errorQuestion "Needs-decision/cancel/unknown versus fault; no silent discard." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-shutdown v:saturationQuestion "Protected control capacity, retained authored state and unresolved obligations." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-assumption a v:ObservationProfile .
v:OBS-PROFILE-assumption v:metricIntent "Declared capability, supported/unsupported and unknown validation classes." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-assumption v:eventIntent "Accepted profile or contradictory/unavailable evidence." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-assumption v:logIntent "Sanitized supplier-contract mismatch only." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-assumption v:traceIntent "Local checks linked to declared provider/profile provenance." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-assumption v:latencyQuestion "Check time/evidence age only where clock/validity is known." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-assumption v:trafficQuestion "Boundary checks, not proof of unseen physical activity." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-assumption v:errorQuestion "Missing/contradictory/unknown evidence distinct; trust is not measured truth." .
v:OBS-PROFILE-assumption v:saturationQuestion "Declared versus observed capacity; native/unobservable quantities remain unknown." .
v:IF-01 v:observationPlan v:OBS-IF-01 .
v:OBS-IF-01 a v:ObservationPlan ; v:forElement v:IF-01 ; v:usesProfile v:OBS-PROFILE-admission ; v:focus "Explicit targets, version/capability discovery and authoritative admission; immutable invocation intent, serialized deduplication and eligibility retirement separate from status/effect retention. Complete finite profiles and fail-fast new atomic refusal preserve explicit bounded queue contracts. Semantic query/local-command/effect-request/evidence categories use validated catalog ownership; routing is not actual publication, launch, completion or recipient release. Separate F01 coherent registry capture, bounded visible list/inspect release and exact-target enablement advice; stale/withheld advice is not disabled state, descriptive aliases are not registration, and positive advice never grants execution." ; v:limit "Discovery is advisory; telemetry neither grants admission nor proves complete ingress observation." ; v:tracesTo v:REQ-12_5_2 .
v:OBS-IF-01 v:observedAt v:INS-01 .
v:OBS-IF-01 v:governedBy v:INV-07 .
v:OBS-IF-01 v:scenario v:SCN-01 .
v:OBS-IF-01 v:scenario v:SCN-04 .
v:IF-02 v:observationPlan v:OBS-IF-02 .
v:OBS-IF-02 a v:ObservationPlan ; v:forElement v:IF-02 ; v:usesProfile v:OBS-PROFILE-release ; v:focus "Snapshot/projection acquisition, scoped non-grant selectors, current per-batch release without leases, expiry and safe unavailable; whole outcome/category/reason/count/correlation/recovery projection and capture ceilings. Distinguish reserved coherent capture, typed context/record/continuation installation and serialized actual recipient ownership transfer. F02 explicitly selects source/annotation scopes; annotation-only access is not a source-byte grant and source-only access is not annotation authority. Multi-document version sets select one published cut with all-required installation, aggregate parent/member/reply capacity and no partial roster or public failing-member index. Every member release validates its owning set and all required members; required loss invalidates the whole set rather than silently returning a subset. F03 pages derive continuation from the visible domain and exact member; repeated pages reuse equivalent live selectors. Protected parent/member stop closes the owning set after actual owner validation, even after content revocation; selectors retire while actual member holds and parent ownership metadata remain charged. F02 bounded source reads report exact context/range coverage, not implicit latest, semantic discovery completeness or edit authority; raw readable snapshot ownership is disclosure of its entire readable extent." ; v:limit "Current release checks are required; previously disclosed bytes cannot be recalled." ; v:tracesTo v:REQ-12_5_2 .
v:OBS-IF-02 v:observedAt v:INS-03 .
v:OBS-IF-02 v:governedBy v:INV-08 .
v:OBS-IF-02 v:governedBy v:INV-09 .
v:OBS-IF-02 v:scenario v:SCN-02 .
