v:IF-05 v:observationPlan v:OBS-IF-05 .
v:OBS-IF-05 a v:ObservationPlan ; v:forElement v:IF-05 ; v:usesProfile v:OBS-PROFILE-derived ; v:focus "Source/context/scope acceptance; partial is not complete. Distinguish grammar syntax, schema conformance and domain-semantic evidence; bind each required claim to owner-resolved source/candidate, retained descriptor, target, scope/query and captured interpretation. Separate required-report intake, equivalent duplicate, identity fault, contradiction and retention exhaustion; loss cannot leave old positive evidence established. Observe bounded preloaded definition closure unavailable/exhausted distinctly from validator conformance. Broader partial analysis does not negate an independently complete narrower claim. Retain declared profile/provider/region context and report handled optional-provider failure without relabeling ordinary source editing as unavailable. Evidence acceptance is not publication or recipient release." ; v:limit "Context gates do not prove parser/schema semantics, complete discovery, actual provider fault containment or native preemption. Raw content, schema locators and provider errors remain disclosure-controlled rather than metric labels." ; v:tracesTo v:REQ-12_5_2 .
