v:PS-PV a v:ProofSlice ; v:scope "Actual Disclosure Next/stutter correspondence plus one diagnostic prepare/drain. Paired fixed recipient profile masks hidden existence/count and private identity correlation; rechecks grant/disposal/epoch at drain. Immutable delivery-time facts ground causal witnesses and authorized masking; four scripted regression paths and endpoint witnesses reject legacy post-delivery/denied-only false positives. Same public schedule; no wall-clock/timing/cache/resource side-channel, statistical anonymity, legal compliance, general unlinkability or retroactive revocation of disclosed data." ; v:module "PrivacySignals" .
