v:ACS-01 a v:AssuranceClaim ; v:claimKind "BoundedSafety" ; v:claimText "Imported save-admission transitions conserve admitted request reservations and their abstract weighted cost, and partition logical offers into admitted/rejected outcomes." ; v:argument "Ghost counters update independently at actual Submit/Cancel/Expire/Resolve actions; compare them with the imported authoritative held set and cost function. Check imported Next correspondence and mutation-sensitive omissions, duplicate refunds, premature refunds and wrong units." ; v:conditions "Four one-shot requests, two resource classes, fixed modeled costs, five-transition horizon; safe-disposition evidence is supplied by the imported Resolve contract." ; v:limit "No repeated operation IDs, actual telemetry accuracy, physical memory, arbitrary-length histories, provider-truth or service theorem." ; v:tracesTo v:REQ-12_5_3 .
