v:ACS-03 a v:AssuranceClaim ; v:claimKind "ConditionalTemporal" ; v:claimText "Every job in a closed finite cooperative backlog eventually receives a disposition under weak fairness of service." ; v:argument "Service removes exactly one pending job, the natural pending cardinality decreases, and non-service actions cannot increase it. Weak fairness prevents perpetual stuttering while service is enabled. Removing fairness must admit an unfinished infinite behavior." ; v:conditions "Two/three initial jobs, no arrivals/retries/new descendants, finite cancellation/invalidation state, cooperative service and explicit WF_vars(Serve). No transition-horizon cutoff is used." ; v:limit "Not a refinement of the engine or host scheduler, open-workload fairness, numeric latency/service bounds, guaranteed applied success or native preemption." ; v:tracesTo v:REQ-12_5_3 .
