v:ACS-04 a v:AssuranceClaim ; v:claimKind "FiniteStateSafety" ; v:claimText "Pending and terminal dispositions partition the modeled backlog; applied outcomes require current uncancelled work and cancellation intent alone does not discharge it." ; v:argument "Check the identity-level partition, stable terminal outcomes and captured acceptance-time facts. Silent dropping, stale success and cancellation-as-discharge each violate a named invariant. Applied, superseded and cancelled are separate legitimate outcomes, not interchangeable successes/errors." ; v:conditions "The fixed cooperative service model classifies each job at its service boundary; dependency correctness is represented by a boolean current fact." ; v:limit "No semantic dependency oracle, public RED/SLI schema, numeric objective, physical-resource ledger or production implementation proof." ; v:tracesTo v:REQ-12_5_3 .
